    "image": "Create a NEW dynamic down-looking macro POV shot, same seated creator, bench, charcoal sleeves, dark trousers and EXACT brown open leather drawstring pouch from image 1. Images 2,3,4,5 define the precise physical currency gem, anatomical heart collectible, rune and brass ear respectively. This is the START of a fast camera dive following loot into pouch: steep downward angle along the falling path, pouch opening centered in lower half, knees framing its sides, cobblestones only soft at top edges. The phone is now outside crop, hands outside crop, creator face not shown. Exactly THREE solid palm-sized tokens in mid-air above opening along an easy straight downward funnel, no overlaps: purple faceted gem lowest near mouth on left, dark red rigid anatomical-heart collectible middle-height on right, pale engraved rune highest near upper-center. All match refs and have correct relative scale, each less than a quarter of pouch mouth width. Exactly TWO small brass ear tokens already rest inside the pouch, visible near inner rear rim; ears are NOT being created. Leave clear visible air gaps between three falling tokens and pouch rim. Faint diminishing neon particles trail above tokens, no levitation beams. Dramatic near-to-far depth, short directional background streaks, object silhouettes sharp. Physical leather and weighted opaque objects, no holograms, coins, blood, extra organs or emoji. Single vertical 9:16 1080x1920 film frame.",
    "endFrameDescription": "Gem, serce i runa leżą już w sakiewce obok dwóch wcześniejszych uszu. Kamera zatrzymana tuż nad otworem, skóra lekko obciążona.",
